{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-158743","model_call":75,"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q56"},"record":{"query":{"op":"next","qid":"q56"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_04_143315727#8_386183245","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q56","rank":8,"snippet":"the French revolution of 1848 really two revolutions? What two European countries were not affected by the Revolution of 1848? The 1789 French Revolution is called the Springtime of Peoples? What happened as a result of Russian revolution? How did the development of Russia cause a revolution? The Revolution influenced a series of <cover>revolts that came to be known as the Springtime of Peoples? \" , \"segment\": \"History What caused the German Revolution of 1848? tttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttt  tttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttt  tttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttt What was a result of the American revolution? the result of American revolution is to stay together. What was the German revolution in 1848 called? In English is March Revolution and in German is Vormärz  (pre-march period) What nations grew out of the Revolution of 1848? Many countries were involved in the European revolutions of 1848 such as France, Italy, Germany, the Netherlands, </cover>Poland, and Austria. However, this uprising had little political impact though it eliminated feudalism in Austria and Prussia and inspired reform in Denmark and the Netherlands. Was the revolution of 1848 successful? i woudnt say yes, i wouldnt say no. How was the French revolution of 1848 really two revolutions?\" , \"start_","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_04_143315727#8_386183245","rank":8,"relevance":1}]},"time":16},"model_calls":75,"document_judgments":35,"relevance_3":10,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
{"actor":"server","event":"request","topic_id":"2024-158743","model_call":75,"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q56"},"model_calls":75,"document_judgments":35,"relevance_3":10,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-158743","model_call":75,"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q56"},"record":{"query":{"op":"next","qid":"q56"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_18_1595005639#1_1796635471","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q56","rank":9,"snippet":"<cover>1848: Reactionaries organize for a counter-revolution 1849–1851: Overthrow of revolutionary regimes Events by country or region Italian states France German states Denmark Schleswig Habsburg Monarchy Hungary Galicia Sweden Switzerland Greater Poland Romanian Principalities Belgium Ireland Spain Other European states Other English-speaking countries Latin America Legacy In popular culture See also References Bibliography Surveys France Germany and Austria Italy Other Historiography External links \" , \"segment\": \"The revolutions spread across Europe after an initial revolution began in France in February. Over 50 countries were affected, but with no significant coordination or cooperation among their respective revolutionaries. Some of the major contributing factors were widespread dissatisfaction with political leadership, demands for more participation in government and democracy, demands for freedom of the press, other demands made by the working class, the upsurge of nationalism, the regrouping of established government forces, and the European Potato Failure, which triggered mass starvation, migration, and civil unrest. The uprisings were led by temporary coalitions of reformers, the middle classes (\\\"the bourgeoisie\\\") and workers. However, the coalitions did not hold together for long. Many of the revolutions were quickly suppressed; tens of thousands of people were killed, and many more </cover>","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_18_1595005639#1_1796635471","rank":9,"relevance":3}]},"time":10},"model_calls":75,"document_judgments":35,"relevance_3":10,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
